-## Subtopics
-
-### Viewing Direction Gaussian Splatting
-Uses 3D Gaussians with view-dependent color. Choose when view-dependent effects are critical and high-speed rasterization is needed. [Link](14273-viewing-direction-gaussian-splatting.md)
-
-### Point-NeRF Representation
